{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "port_developers_seaport_tick",
  "spec": ["port-developers 4.4", "port-developers 4.5", "port-developers 4.8"],
  "description": "The seaport month. Adoption sets line 1 to 500 and the port's trip capacity to trunc(650 x fr) = 650, and asks for an access recheck. The month: SetMaxTripCapacity again, then the recheck (once): the port has no sea access, so its props with property 0xC98204B8 are switched to state 1 and BAD_SEAPORT_LOCATION (0x4A490D33) is pushed; the trips are the freight arrivals (300): efficiency 1 - 300/650, usage 300/650, history round(53.85) = 54. The end of a terrain operation (0x6A3B0AFD) rebuilds the map and rechecks: the port now touches the sea through (2,1), so nothing is switched. At 640 arrivals (>= 624) the seaport offers GROW_SEAPORT (0x8A394DC4); the message (which no shipped advice sends) grows it like an airport and OnStageChange sets the new capacity (900).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pd_create", "kind": "seaport"},
    {"op": "pd_env", "terrain": [4, 3], "water": [[0, 0], [1, 0], [1, 1], [3, 2]]},
    {"op": "pd_init"},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x20", "config": ["0x4A52917D", 1], "x": 2, "z": 1},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x200", "lot": "0x20"},
    {"op": "pd_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x200"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "full_expenses", "value": 500}, {"event": "trip_capacity", "lot": "0x20", "type": 3, "capacity": 650}]},
    {"op": "pd_expect", "state": {"recheck_access": true}},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x20", "arrived": 300},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "trip_capacity", "lot": "0x20", "type": 3, "capacity": 650}, {"event": "props_state", "lot": "0x20", "property": "0xC98204B8", "state": 1}, {"event": "advisor", "id": "0x4A490D33"}, {"event": "effects", "lot": "0x20", "old": 0, "new": 0.46153846}, {"event": "condition", "lot": "0x20", "condition": 0}, {"event": "history", "key": "0xEA3E904A", "value": 54}]},
    {"op": "pd_expect", "state": {"recheck_access": false}},
    {"op": "pd_query", "query": "num_trips", "expect": 300},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "props_state"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "pd_env", "water": [[0, 0], [1, 0], [1, 1], [3, 2], [2, 1]]},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x6A3B0AFD", "expect": true},
    {"op": "pd_expect_port", "index": 0, "state": {"access": true}},
    {"op": "pd_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "props_state"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x20", "arrived": 640},
    {"op": "pd_clear_events"},
    {"op": "pd_month"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "advisor"}, "events": [{"event": "advisor", "id": "0x8A394DC4"}]},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x8A394DC4"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "start_demolish", "lot": "0x20"}, {"event": "end_demolish", "lot": "0x20"}, {"event": "create_lot", "x": 2, "z": 1, "width": 1, "depth": 1, "facing": 0, "lot": "0x9000"}, {"event": "set_configuration", "lot": "0x9000", "config": "0x4A63F3C1"}, {"event": "construct", "lot": "0x9000", "config": "0x4A63F3C1"}, {"event": "withdraw", "amount": 6000}, {"event": "trip_capacity", "lot": "0x9000", "type": 3, "capacity": 900}, {"event": "full_expenses", "value": 600}]}
  ]
}
